sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Passenger
    participant UI as React SPA
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant S as Search Service
    participant R as Redis Cache
    participant B as Booking Service
    participant DB as Azure SQL railwaydb
    participant PS as Payment Service
    participant PSP as Payment Provider
    participant N as Notification Service
    P->>UI: Enter source destination and travel date
    UI->>GW: GET api v1 trains search with JWT
    GW->>S: Forward with correlation ID
    S->>R: Read cached availability
    alt Cache hit
        R-->>S: Availability p95 under 500 ms
    else Cache miss
        S->>DB: Query schedules and seat inventory
        DB-->>S: Trains fares and class availability
        S->>R: Populate cache 60s TTL
    end
    S-->>UI: Matching trains with schedules and fares
    P->>UI: Select train class and passengers max 6
    UI->>B: POST api v1 bookings with Idempotency Key
    B->>DB: Pessimistic lock and hold seats 15 minutes
    DB-->>B: Booking reference created
    UI->>PS: Create payment intent
    PS->>PSP: Tokenised payment intent no card data stored
    PSP-->>PS: HMAC SHA256 signed webhook settlement
    alt Payment settled
        PS->>DB: Confirm booking and issue ticket
        PS->>N: Publish BookingConfirmed event
        N-->>P: Email and SMS confirmation
    else Payment failed or hold expired
        PS->>DB: Release seat hold no confirmed ticket
        PS-->>UI: RFC 7807 problem details with correlation ID
    end